message: "If you use this workflow design or software in research, please cite it using this metadata. Citation is appreciated and does not add conditions to the MIT License."
type: software
title: "MedChem Human Loop: Traceable Evidence for Human-Guided Molecular Optimization"
authors:
  - name: "whlym"
abstract: "A human-in-the-loop molecular optimization toolkit with auditable OpenMM utilities, local case retrieval, constrained aromatic graph edits, rule-based route suggestions, frozen evidence review and human decision records, plus an HPC agent runbook. Real case curation, constrained diffusion and complete compute orchestration remain future work; this is not a trained reinforcement-learning or autonomous drug-discovery system. Author mark: whlym. Developed with AI assistance."
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-04
repository-code: "https://github.com/whlym248/medchem-human-loop"
url: "https://github.com/whlym248/medchem-human-loop"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - medicinal chemistry
  - human-in-the-loop
  - molecular dynamics
  - evidence provenance
  - molecular optimization
